ebrahim.gof at the commit used by the study; it keeps its own licence, GPL-3,
as stated in its DESCRIPTION file.

No data from the International Stroke Trial, CRASH-2, the Sepsis Survival
Minimal Clinical Records or the PhysioNet/CinC Challenge 2012 are included.
No model weights are included.
